---
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white border-b border-stone-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium text-stone-600 bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 mb-4 shadow-2xs">
        Craftsmanship & Leadership
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Di Balik Akordium Lab
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        Studio ini digerakkan oleh prinsip bahwa software bernilai tinggi lahir dari kedalaman rekayasa teknis, bukan sekadar kecepatan merakit template.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Profile Box -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/90 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-center">
        
        <!-- Left: Avatar & Visual Stamp (4 cols) -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="relative w-32 h-32 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 rounded-full p-1 bg-white border-2 border-stone-200 shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-linear-to-br from-stone-800 to-stone-950 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-mono text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter">
              FN
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="font-sans font-extrabold text-lg text-stone-900">Faiq Najib</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-500 font-semibold mt-0.5">Principal Software Engineer</div>
            <span class="inline-block mt-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-accent-700 bg-accent-50 border border-accent-200">
              Founder, Akordium Lab
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Professional Narrative & Track Record (8 cols) -->
        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
            Berpengalaman lebih dari 6 tahun dalam rekayasa backend terdistribusi, telemetri IoT, dan perancangan platform SaaS modern. Menangani otomasi transaksi berkinerja tinggi di industri perbankan nasional (Bank Mega), memimpin arsitektur telemetri real-time untuk 10.000+ armada kendaraan (Orin GPS), dan mengelola produk in-house dengan Clean Architecture.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Akordium Lab dibangun sebagai boutique studio independen untuk memberikan alternatif bagi pemilik bisnis yang lelah dengan agensi template atau agensi besar berbiaya overhead tinggi. Di sini, Anda berdiskusi dan berkolaborasi langsung dengan engineer yang mendesain arsitektur dan menulis kode sistem Anda.
          </p>

          <!-- Core Tech Skills Pills -->
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-stone-200 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-stone-700">
              Go (Fiber & pgx)
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-stone-200 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-stone-700">
              PostgreSQL & TimescaleDB
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-stone-200 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-stone-700">
              Laravel & Flux UI Pro
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-stone-200 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-stone-700">
              Clean Architecture & TDD
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Social Links -->
          <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold border-t border-stone-200/80">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/fanajib5"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-700 hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span>GitHub</span>
            </a>
            <a
              href="/card/faiq"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-700 hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v9a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-5m-4 0V5a2 2 0 114 0v1m-4 0a2 2 0 104 0m-5 8a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4zm0 0c1.306 0 2.417.835 2.83 2M9 14a3.001 3.001 0 00-2.83 2M15 11h3m-3 4h2" />
              </svg>
              <span>Digital Card (VCard)</span>
            </a>
            <a
              href="/blog"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-accent-700 hover:text-accent-800 transition-colors font-bold"
            >
              <span>Baca Catatan Teknis &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
